---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import OlerPhoto from './assets/oler-photo.jpg'
---
<section class="bg-white py-24 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-5 gap-16 items-start">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <Image
        src={OlerPhoto}
        alt="Oler Oladele, CFA"
        class="w-full h-auto object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <span class="block text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#CC9200] mb-5">Your Camp Director</span>
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-black mb-8">Hi, I'm Oler — And I Care About Your Child's Future</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed mb-5">Over my 17-year career in financial markets and corporate Treasury, I've seen firsthand how a lack of early financial literacy destroys potential. I created this camp because our young people shouldn't have to figure out the financial system by trial and error.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed mb-5">They deserve biblical truth, structural knowledge, and professional guidance and that is exactly what this camp delivers. I am a CFA Charterholder, a former securities trader, and a children's church teacher at The Covenant Nation. I regularly deliver financial education to young people at schools and summer camps across Nigeria.</p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed mb-8">This camp is more than education. It's a mission to raise financially wise, faith-filled leaders who know that wealth is a tool for God's purpose not an end in itself. Let's give them a generational head start, together.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {[
          'CFA Charterholder',
          'IFC Certified Trainer',
          'Covenant Nation Teacher',
          '17 Years in Financial Markets',
          'Cambridge Rising Women Leaders',
          'Oxford Executive Leadership Programme',
        ].map((cred) => (
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FFFBEA] text-[#7A5500]">{cred}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
